    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i get that it's risky but i really can't afford to miss training days by being too sore to move. if i were to take a high dose of something like ibuprofen alongside the tylenol, would that help me get the coverage i need without hitting the ceiling on just one? i need a regimen that actually works for an athlete's level of pain.",
